{"agency_id": "ministry-of-health", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz/post/3lwajk2gji22e", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:16+00:00", "content": "Medsafe has opened a consultation on proposals to reduce barriers to accessing clozapine, a medicine used to treat treatment-resistant schizophrenia.\n\nHave your say here: www.health.govt.nz/news/consult...", "content_hash": "728101ae05415c1f5a2a2972036c78d37ea1a443c50b36f6228b3fba096aa9f8", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/app.bsky.feed.post/3lwajk2gji22e", "cid": "bafyreicw5bpfujeht5uhaugo3fu3odl7prq7zktqwz5pti43w4ibq2jomm", "source_id": "ministry-of-health-bluesky-c521eae2"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "blue tile with white text which reads have your say clozapine access consultation begins wednesday 8 october 2025 at the bottom are the logos for te kawanatanga o aotearoa new zealand government and ministry of health manatu hauora", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/bafkreieopvquyiqg7tuhdwesxpkkmo5ki2xl4jfdfethwrtoccu2xcb5ci", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/bafkreieopvquyiqg7tuhdwesxpkkmo5ki2xl4jfdfethwrtoccu2xcb5ci"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-13T00:02:39.764Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-08\\3lwajk2gji22e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lwajk2gji22e", "source_account": "health.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lxgo5ob6l22v", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Giving people access across his land to a “magical” waterfall is its own reward, Tararua sheep and beef farmer Marty Hull says. 🐄🐑", "content_hash": "2103e08bce2d81396fbe34135b281b8cb1415bc48bed986ffe5cb7d73d654046", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lxgo5ob6l22v", "cid": "bafyreibch5te3otevihgsnskr4iu337hcjs2ya6fb5gmcpnzcjw6uxlszq", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-28T04:06:23.123Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lxgo5ob6l22v.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lxgo5ob6l22v", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lx6tgszng22e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "WAMS, our outdoor access mapping system, will be undergoing maintenance on Tues evening, 26 Aug. \nAll maps, dashboards, and data services will be unavailable during the upgrade. This is a standard upgrade, and we do not expect issues. However, if you find anything not working on Weds, let us know.", "content_hash": "95d8496009ef3934daddfcaf78dbb014bcae858b3988d5e87608e938c49fc706", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lx6tgszng22e", "cid": "bafyreialk7npahvaptve2chemxcje4v5z3xm5kgth5km2dfaijcmtotz5q", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "An image of a yellow digger repairing a dirt road in the countryside. The tet reads: Beware: map maintenance is occurring!", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreib4azcn6rmb54pwtjcopdhs3k7wezhcr2bfhvj5eghb3scqavlph4", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreib4azcn6rmb54pwtjcopdhs3k7wezhcr2bfhvj5eghb3scqavlph4"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-25T01:19:40.874Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lx6tgszng22e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lx6tgszng22e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lx6jzwat7c2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "It’s worth noting that the recent Supreme Court case about navigable rivers does not change public access rights to those rivers. Everyone can continue to have free public access on the marine and coastal area, including the mouth of navigable rivers.  www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/types-of-acc...", "content_hash": "6599837676dba2fa05d4a8a12d474b40650d88bd2d92973f0212cc98cfbe22e2", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lx6jzwat7c2e", "cid": "bafyreifq5zip76wwrkcfrrzsf73ufm3admswkv2hp4yxopik5rtdwtcmz4", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Infographic about navigable rivers. \nWhat is a navigable river?\n•\tSufficient width and depth for \n\tboats, barges, punts, or rafts.\n•\tIt need not be navigable at all \n\ttimes.\nWho owns the riverbed?\n•\tThe crown normally owns the \n\triverbed.\n•\tIwi and hapū with mana whenua \n\tmay be granted customary \n\tmarine title rights near a river \n\tmouth.\nPublic access rights\n•\tYou can usually enter navigable \n\trivers legally.\n•\tGenerally, access will only be \n\topposed if there’s a conflicting \n\tuse, such as hydroelectric \n\tdamming or another right.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifkshlz7nzlacxks67xrajmevomqvhyv2jxkfj6pe6rbom54xcd4a", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifkshlz7nzlacxks67xrajmevomqvhyv2jxkfj6pe6rbom54xcd4a"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-24T22:31:24.392Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lx6jzwat7c2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lx6jzwat7c2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lwnfi3ckdc2o", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "We sent Claudia Eustace a chocolate fish to thank her for the work she did organising contractors to clear gorse along a mapped but unmarked route that, now that it is clear, restores access to the ECNZ track on the east side of Hutt Valley. 🍫🐟📬 \nwww.huttcity.govt.nz/environment-...", "content_hash": "1451064136d08f31dd5244304f37f33175cc1b847ac58b8ecfbe20dce4c5f02a", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lwnfi3ckdc2o", "cid": "bafyreiavl6eigszubtrix2ojg73nlzvqtdvgfnu27ew5p6rvvl5gnmq2hi", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "An envelope addressed to Claudia Eustace contains a large chocolate fish, thanking her for her work on public outdoor access. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreib6zul3bu2rwnpp5qbockb2ucdozpgj7rj64bgowh7ck3h465q6ba", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreib6zul3bu2rwnpp5qbockb2ucdozpgj7rj64bgowh7ck3h465q6ba"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-18T02:54:35.204Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lwnfi3ckdc2o.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lwnfi3ckdc2o", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lwdhjzkvak2u", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "They haven’t done it yet. It's a proposal that we are submitting our opposition to. It's important to note that because it is an unformed legal road, it is not on private land. It is a separate, public land parcel. You can read more here: www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/our-work/new...", "content_hash": "80d99915cf943fda5e3ae2da4a6e45331cec5ea53f685468b2dbb4dd4cfd36ea", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lwdhjzkvak2u", "cid": "bafyreielxxl76vtg4ykozetfkvzroxoyfirhx3zeecxnqd46v2e7kj32bi", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-14T04:04:50.594Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lwdhjzkvak2u.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lwdhjzkvak2u", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lwcsn5qkls2i", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "In our submission opposing South Wairarapa District Council proposed bylaw to restrict access on an unformed legal road at Cape Palliser we said the council’s proposed bylaw is unprecedented. Roads exist to provide public\naccess, but the bylaw seeks to prohibit public access.", "content_hash": "435c923d2a2c9dfcc3b58c8e5ee9512d320986963294d039b808b2d1d793e5a2", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lwcsn5qkls2i", "cid": "bafyreigtjhw6bktna77zfruugscwdtkoxkvup3bvk26nbcerp276enzxg4", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-13T21:50:47.058Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lwcsn5qkls2i.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lwcsn5qkls2i", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lw5tcyv2ec2r", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Join us for our Trailmakers Online Hui on Thu 28 Aug, at 11:45am. Don't miss Ella Creagh from Sport NZ sharing insights on the benefits of nature for our youth at noon. Plus, tune in early to hear from Nathan Watson and Bevan Smith about the Plan My Walk app.\nRegister here: rangatahi.lilregie.com", "content_hash": "3c4984fbfe79bdcb9fd7f652fd829caf0a4d6e649b68586cad5159488e24c0b9", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lw5tcyv2ec2r", "cid": "bafyreidvznqhci3qgi5u7qz2anoiredreczkm2nfanywoukrpi7dywyrey", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifgb632lficndswoxr3bgkk2u5x4cbsi5hc5hauxdbdkt2t4of4j4", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreifgb632lficndswoxr3bgkk2u5x4cbsi5hc5hauxdbdkt2t4of4j4"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-11T22:19:41.449Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lw5tcyv2ec2r.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lw5tcyv2ec2r", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lw3qk2pcsc2b", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "We've just sent tramper Graeme Ferrier a chocolate fish to thank him for his tireless and enthusiastic advocacy for public outdoor access at the top of the South Island. \nEach month, we send fish to people who go above and beyond to support public outdoor access. 🍫🐟📬", "content_hash": "95aea95f4b84e7b07a1eea2725cc641be5955111cc7b7ae46998a8213c13c88f", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lw3qk2pcsc2b", "cid": "bafyreianadh6yvglzqzovstjawvaakbj3tdlui2bdl4t3fhhzryyxekwum", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Large chocolate fish poking out of a postage envelope addressed to Graeme Ferrier.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreidh5vg4354c3t2mk6nc66xxplpbse6u62aj3zl6u4ikfj56q76aly", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreidh5vg4354c3t2mk6nc66xxplpbse6u62aj3zl6u4ikfj56q76aly"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-11T02:24:37.546Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lw3qk2pcsc2b.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lw3qk2pcsc2b", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lvp4o65q622d", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "We're looking for a talented Chief Executive to lead our work in protecting and enhancing public access to Aotearoa New Zealand’s whenua, rivers, coasts, and open spaces.\nwww.seek.co.nz/job/86272433... \nInquiries and applications through Seek.", "content_hash": "9e4e9a1a3e56b775150e005f45bd3b1db5508c224c3c278af54e1749175b0302", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lvp4o65q622d", "cid": "bafyreib6eetvsika3qfak2kwnstzsrh6jtugxx6ilc2hxjnwzmw2nzjjcu", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-08-06T01:57:03.695Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lvp4o65q622d.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lvp4o65q622d", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lvokyfa6r22m", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Here are some points to consider about South Wairarapa District Council’s proposed new bylaw that would restrict pedestrians, cyclists, 4WDers, and other members of the public from public access on an unformed legal road that passes around Cape Palliser: www.herengaanuku.govt.nz/our-work/new...", "content_hash": "886b7a163dd4074e0690c2758a93b1f9d5e60ac346941e4a7cdf00aaf0824ed0", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lvokyfa6r22m", "cid": "bafyreiccjshho7ktfc2sokmleswv3xxcd2fa2543wueuqkynbvijgn2cae", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Public access areas map of Cape Palliser showing the unformed legal road along the coast. ", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreictaztgx6l7ljyqmvv6wm2bsyon3dwkuehj2ocemcqi7wsnbuqduq", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreictaztgx6l7ljyqmvv6wm2bsyon3dwkuehj2ocemcqi7wsnbuqduq"}], "original_created_at": "2025-08-05T20:40:39.279Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-08/3lvokyfa6r22m.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lvokyfa6r22m", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
